    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>It's time to grow your restaurant step by step</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The layout of your restaurant , your staff's performance, and every item on your menu affect customer satisfaction. Small adjustments can make a big difference, and by considering reviews, you can gradually fix what's missing. Step by step, turn an ordinary place into the most popular and talked-about restaurant in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Restaurant building</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/42fdde77391729813bd2c7b163fba277.poster.avif?t=1750055788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/42fdde77391729813bd2c7b163fba277.webm?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/42fdde77391729813bd2c7b163fba277.mp4?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a small bistro by arranging tables, counters, and kitchen equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Staff management</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/19a7c3e7e0cf78b04253fef22126de3a.poster.avif?t=1750055788\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/19a7c3e7e0cf78b04253fef22126de3a.webm?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/19a7c3e7e0cf78b04253fef22126de3a.mp4?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire waiters, chefs, and cleaners. Track each employee\u2019s duties and improve their skills to speed up the service flow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Menu customization</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/7747f00952f10495cd09d6f4f7fb2ebc.poster.avif?t=1750055788\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/7747f00952f10495cd09d6f4f7fb2ebc.webm?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/7747f00952f10495cd09d6f4f7fb2ebc.mp4?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by learning new recipes, adding or removing them from the menu. Decide which dishes to serve and their prices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Reviews</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/e315192a0b6606076201b14d8da51d68.poster.avif?t=1750055788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/e315192a0b6606076201b14d8da51d68.webm?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/e315192a0b6606076201b14d8da51d68.mp4?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers leave positive or negative reviews based on service speed, ambiance, and food. Negative feedback helps you identify areas for improvement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Strategic progression</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/6e1a24fde2e49a28d9a9d6e8fb226545.poster.avif?t=1750055788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/6e1a24fde2e49a28d9a9d6e8fb226545.webm?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/6e1a24fde2e49a28d9a9d6e8fb226545.mp4?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze incoming reviews, address shortcomings, and track your finances. Increase your income to expand your restaurant with new equipment and decor, and open new locations.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>It's time to grow your restaurant step by step</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The layout of your restaurant , your staff's performance, and every item on your menu affect customer satisfaction. Small adjustments can make a big difference, and by considering reviews, you can gradually fix what's missing. Step by step, turn an ordinary place into the most popular and talked-about restaurant in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Restaurant building</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/42fdde77391729813bd2c7b163fba277.poster.avif?t=1750055788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/42fdde77391729813bd2c7b163fba277.webm?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/42fdde77391729813bd2c7b163fba277.mp4?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a small bistro by arranging tables, counters, and kitchen equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Staff management</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/19a7c3e7e0cf78b04253fef22126de3a.poster.avif?t=1750055788\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/19a7c3e7e0cf78b04253fef22126de3a.webm?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sh