video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers leave positive or negative reviews based on service speed, ambiance, and food. Negative feedback helps you identify areas for improvement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Strategic progression</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/6e1a24fde2e49a28d9a9d6e8fb226545.poster.avif?t=1750055788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/6e1a24fde2e49a28d9a9d6e8fb226545.webm?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690380/extras/6e1a24fde2e49a28d9a9d6e8fb226545.mp4?t=1750055788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze incoming reviews, address shortcomings, and track your finances. Increase your income to expand your restaurant with new equipment and decor, and open new locations.</p></li></ul>",
